      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Mesa Arizona Temple, once called the Lamanite Temple, was dedicated in 1927 and rededicated in 2021 after a major renovation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
